  "skill_summaries": {
    "ultimate": "fire cannons dealing AoE damage to enemies",
    "skill1": "intangible phase grants physical immunity with sustained HP regeneration",
    "skill2": "arc damage stealing enemy energy",
    "skill3": "ATK grows higher during intangible phase",
    "skill4": "summon minions; on defeat, they deal AoE damage and reduce enemy energy",
    "skill5": "cannon hits reduce target Phys DEF"
  },
  "play_overview": "Hodgkin phases **physically immune** with sustained regeneration, then fires cannons for **AoE damage** while ATK climbs during intangibility. Arc strikes **steal enemy energy**, and defeated minions **explode for AoE** while draining more energy from nearby foes. Cannon hits also **shave Phys DEF** on targets, softening them for follow-up physical damage from allies. Summoned bodies give him **extra detonation points** across the field when they fall in clusters. During intangible phase his ATK climbs higher, making cannon windows the main damage spike. He shines when enemies bunch for cannon fire and minion pops chain together. **Magic damage** or teams that kill minions before they explode blunt his energy drain and DEF shred loop.",
  "counter_overview": "Hodgkin phases **physically immune** with regeneration, then fires cannons for AoE while ATK climbs, steals energy, and pops minions for more drain plus Phys DEF shred. Do not dump physical burst into the ethereal window — answer with **magic** lasting coverage like [[Shemira]] or [[Frieren]], and blunt the regen with [[filter:heal-inhibitor]] like [[Gwyneth]] or [[Satrana]]. Cancel Cannon Fire with [[Lily May]] once he is interruptible. Kill or scatter minions before they detonate so the energy-drain chain never snowballs."
}
